# This course needs ONE model API key, for the CEO and its agents to reason with.
# Paperclip itself runs locally with no account (npx paperclipai onboard --yes,
# loopback mode); the key is only for the model the agents run on.
#
# Use whichever provider you have (Claude is Paperclip's default):
#
#   export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="..."   # for the claude_local adapter
#   export OPENAI_API_KEY="..."      # for codex_local
#   export GEMINI_API_KEY="..."      # for gemini_local
#
# Export it in your shell before Scenario 2; never write it into this file or
# any committed file (see AGENTS.md, "Secrets discipline"). Budgets cap the spend.
